    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">All Prevalences</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Prevalence Statistic Record</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Class generated from source table 'all_prevalences'.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A statistical record summarising the prevalence of a given item (for example a condition, diagnosis, medication or other clinical concept) within a population. Each record is identified by its ITEM value and reports the number of occurrences, the size of the reference population, the population type, and the derived prevalence rate and percentage. Generated from source table 'all_prevalences'.</rdfs:comment>
