    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Allergies</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Class generated from source table 'allergies'.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An allergy record documenting that a patient has an allergy or intolerance. The allergy was recorded during a clinical encounter and is identified by a clinical allergy code. Each record is uniquely identified by the combination of patient, encounter and allergy code, which is the composite primary key of the source table 'allergies'.</rdfs:comment>
