    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Data property generated from source column 'medications.CODE' with range xsd:integer.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Coded identifier of the medication (column medications.CODE). The integer is a nominal code from a clinical drug terminology (likely RxNorm), not an ordinal or quantitative value; arithmetic comparison is not meaningful. Its human-readable meaning is given by medications_DESCRIPTION. Not nullable; part of the composite primary key.</rdfs:comment>
