    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Data property generated from source column 'allergies.START' with range xsd:string.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The date on which the allergy was first observed or became active, from column allergies.START. The source schema types this column as a string, so the range is xsd:string to stay consistent with the direct mapping; values are expected in a date format and should be retyped to xsd:date upstream. The value is optional (nullable).</rdfs:comment>
    <prov:wasDerivedFrom rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontology/provenance/allergies/START"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
